# Explicit **/ prefixes, not bare names — bare patterns weren't reliably excluding nested
# occurrences (e.g. packages/circuits/build), so the build context sent to the Docker daemon
# was ballooning toward the full ~22GB repo (circuits alone carries ~9GB of local zkey/ptau/
# rapidsnark artifacts) even though these names were already listed. See ENGINEERING.md's
# Decisions Log.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/artifacts
**/cache
**/.nx
**/*.log
.git
**/.env
# Circuit trusted-setup / proving artifacts — large, regenerated or downloaded on demand,
# never needed as Docker build input for any of coordinator/backend/frontend.
**/zkeys
**/ptau
**/rapidsnark
